<hi> User Stories <h1>

## Customer
- As a customer, I want to book an appointment online so that I can schedule visits easily.
- As a customer, I want to receive reminders so that I don’t miss appointments.
- As a customer, I want to be able to buy pet products and get it delivered to my doorstep

## Vet
- As a vet, I want to update my availability so that customers can book accurate time slots.

## Admin
- As an admin, I want to manage user accounts so that the system remains secure.
